  "notes": "{弱|よわ}める means to weaken or reduce something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive, ichidan verb)\n- Pair: ⟦{弱|よわ}まる→弱まる：02330_yowamaru⟧ (intransitive, \"to become weak\")\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{火|ひ}→火：02248_hi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{弱|よわ}める: to reduce the heat (cooking)\n- ⟦{勢|いきお}い→勢い：01782_ikioi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{弱|よわ}める: to reduce momentum\n- ⟦{抵抗|ていこう}→抵抗：03540_teikou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{弱|よわ}める: to weaken resistance\n- ⟦{影響|えいきょう}→影響：01877_eikyou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{弱|よわ}める: to diminish influence\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{弱|よわ}い→弱い：00825_yowai⟧: weak (adjective)\n- ⟦{弱|よわ}まる→弱まる：02330_yowamaru⟧: to weaken (intransitive)\n- ⟦{弱|よわ}さ→弱さ：27925_yowasa⟧: weakness (noun)",
